# ArduRocket gentle starting gains -- Appendix B.2 of ARDUROCKET_PLAN.md.
# Sized so a 20 deg lean gives ~half fin and a large ~40 deg IN-FLIGHT upset gives ~full
# fin (not the rail -- the rail is capped at 20 deg). The cascade produces roughly
#     fin ~= ATC_ANG_P * angle_err * ATC_RAT_P
# so the ANG_P*RAT_P product ~1.4 puts full fin near 40 deg. No flight integrator.
# A STARTING POINT for tuning, not flight-ready. Load automatically by the `gains` test, or:
#     rocket_test.py step --gains gentle_gains.parm
ATC_ANG_RLL_P 6.0
ATC_ANG_PIT_P 6.0
ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.24
ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.24
ATC_RAT_RLL_D 0.01
ATC_RAT_PIT_D 0.01
ATC_RAT_RLL_I 0.0
ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.0
